Subject: [PATCH] Leaf: Remove stream in PlayerSensor

Co-authored by: HaHaWTH <102713261+HaHaWTH@users.noreply.github.com>
As part of: Leaf (https://github.com/Winds-Studio/Leaf/blob/ver/1.21.8/leaf-server/minecraft-patches/features/0145-Remove-stream-in-PlayerSensor.patch)
